OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Wales' international school
OL,4,Atest results tell us
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales' results in international maths,
OL,7,Freading and science tests have been
OL,8,Fcalled "catastrophic" by some, while
OL,9,Fothers have warned against using "just
OL,10,Fone narrow measure" as a verdict on
OL,11,Feducation standards.
OL,13,FTuesday's publication of the latest
OL,14,FProgramme for International Student
OL,15,FAssessment (Pisa) study showed Welsh
OL,16,Fteenagers' scores had fallen further
OL,17,Fbehind 15-year-olds in other UK
OL,18,Fnations.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
