OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Wales' international school
OL,4,Atest results tell us
OL,5,
OL,6,FEducation Minister Anna Brychan said
OL,7,FWales' scores were "not where we want
OL,8,Fthem to be" and a new literacy and
OL,9,Fnumeracy plan would be unveiled next
OL,10,Fweek.
OL,12,FWhat else does the data tell us about
OL,13,Fhow the nation's education system is
OL,14,Fperforming?
